# Read by ripgrep-based search (agents' Grep/Glob, rg, Zed, VS Code). .gitignore
# decides what's hidden; this file only re-includes gitignored things worth
# searching. Anything not listed here stays hidden, fnox's local overrides
# included, since they can hold secrets.

# Shared working memory for agents and sessions
!.scratch/

# mise's local overrides: plain config, same patterns as in .gitignore
!mise*.local.toml
!.mise*.local.toml
!**/mise/config*.local.toml
